# MUI Styling

## Components and theme

- Use MUI components for UI elements
- Define colors, typography, and component defaults in `src/theme.js`
- Never hardcode colors or fonts in components — read them from the theme

## Layout and responsiveness

- Prefer `sx` for styling
- Use MUI layout components: `Box`, `Container`, `Stack`, `Grid`
- Use MUI breakpoints; build mobile-first

## Reuse

- Extract repeated `sx` patterns into shared components or theme overrides

## Do not

- Do not add Tailwind, styled CSS files, or other CSS frameworks
- Do not introduce competing styling systems alongside MUI
